// ============================================================================
//  main.kn — Semantic Search Engine Entry Point
//
//  THE BEAST: All 7 semantic layers fused in a real tool.
//
//  Layers exercised:
//    L7: actor (IndexWorker), collapse/observe/decay (postings scan)
//    L6: axiom (fast_tokenizer, bm25_stability), shatter struct (Posting, FSTNode)
//    L5: pulse (reindex_watcher), resonate (SearchIndex.doc_count)
//    L4: orchestrate (build_pipeline)
//    L3: converge (tokenize, bm25_score)
//    L2: patch (store_indexed_file, finalize_index), law (index invariants)
//    L1: world (SearchIndex, SubsystemRegistry)
//    L0: fn, struct, let, if, while, match, use, mod
//
//  CLI dispatch: index | query | connect | profile | stats | watch
// ============================================================================

